														</div>
			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-3563770">
									

<p>Extremely good. Brilliant. In particular, I appreciate how the drip-feed of Morrison info throughout the -01 doc kept me intrigued while you went about explaining everything else; how you convincingly evoked the half-maturity of the anomaly's inhabitants through that well-written dialogue; the emotional punch and deep exploration of the central idea; how, when you needed to justify a plot device, you waited until a little while after introducing it to do so, which avoided anything seeming too contrived; how parsimoniously (in the sense of &quot;efficiently impactful&quot;) you've structured and developed each section of writing; and the lovely twist at the end.</p>
<p>You clearly put a lot of thought into this, and it's paid off spectacularly. Well done.</p>

							</div>

								
